    LLM: 'Game: Yukon. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Yukon is a solitaire/patience card game similar to Klondike. 52 cards. 7 tableau columns. Key difference: can move ANY face-up card plus all cards covering it (no sequence required). No stock pile â€” all 52 cards dealt to tableau. Build foundations Aâ†’K by suit. Empty columns = Kings only.',
    objective: 'Move all 52 cards onto four foundations, building each foundation in suit from Ace to King. Clear the tableau by building down in alternating colors and moving groups of face-up cards; only Kings may occupy empty columns.',
